">thinking beyond</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"435\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the moment</text><circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"600\" r=\"110\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"590\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">THE SELF:</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"615\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a relation that</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"640\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">relates to itself</text><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"290\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"530\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,4\"/><line x1=\"810\" y1=\"290\" x2=\"610\" y2=\"530\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,4\"/><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"330\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"560\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,4\"/><line x1=\"810\" y1=\"330\" x2=\"620\" y2=\"560\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,4\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"800\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"15\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"850\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Being a self is a TASK, not a fixed fact.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"890\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">When the relation misrelates to itself,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"930\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the result is DESPAIR</text></svg>",
            "caption": "The self is the active relating of finite/infinite and temporal/eternal — a task, not a given fact."
